As other's havealready mentioned, there are a couple of problems with
your plan.  As the game generate more artifacts (You have the key and
the Orb already, and you might have more artifacts in the game you
haven't mentioned to us yet) the probability of successfully wishing
for an artifact decreases.  Also, your Orb can definitely be stolen,
even if you genocide nymphs and monkeys.

If you *know* you don't have any other artifact generated in the game,
other than those two, you could definitely go for some Quest Artifact.
You have enough wishes.  I recommend you to take a look at some neutral
artifacts, since they have the best selection of quest artifacts, and
you just have to take off the helmet to become neutral.  Then you can
wear some other helmet that's more useful, like Helm of Brilliance.

I wouldn't bother to genocide nymphs and monkeys, but you could.  All
you need is a magic marker (or two or three or four since you've got
many wishes) and you can really wipe out many many many monsters...

